# Kernel-pentest VM runtime. None of this is a build input — nothing under vm/
# is COPYed into any stage — but it is where the base image (200MB), the
# per-campaign clones, the keyfiles (which hold root passwords) and the flag
# seeds live, plus the control sockets. The sockets are why a classic-builder
# run logs "archive/tar: sockets not supported". Keep the scripts; exclude the
# runtime.
vm/base
vm/images
vm/state
vm/serial
vm/run
